      "uncited_sentences": [
        "The proposed solutions to the seq2seq shortcomings include practical solutions to overconfidence in predictions and a tendency to produce incomplete transcriptions when language models are used.",
        "For overconfidence, the model can be constrained to emit the EOS token only when its probability is within a certain range of the most probable token.",
        "For incomplete transcripts, a coverage term can be used to prevent looping over the utterance, ensuring that once a frame receives a cumulative attention greater than a threshold, it is counted as selected and subsequent selections do not reduce the decoding cost.",
        "Additionally, extending the beam search cost with a language modeling term can help, but it faces challenges due to model overconfidence and the need to add a recording coverage term to prevent incomplete transcripts."
      ]
    }
  }
